  "npcs": [
    {
      "id": "elder_maren",
      "name": "Elder Maren",
      "look": "elder",
      "x": 21,
      "y": 13,
      "facing": "down",
      "lines": [
        "Kael. The sky burns redder each dusk.",
        "The Forgotten Chapel to the north has been sealed since before I was born.",
        "The old records speak of Aether as if it were a river beneath the world.",
        "Some say the Eidolons once helped keep that current in balance. I wonder what they remember.",
        "Stay close to the village for now, child. There are things stirring beyond the old road."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "farmer_tobin",
      "name": "Tobin",
      "look": "farmer",
      "x": 7,
      "y": 18,
      "facing": "left",
      "lines": [
        "These ash-grey turnips are all that grow anymore.",
        "Something has been digging through my field at night..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lira",
      "name": "Lira",
      "look": "child",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 16,
      "facing": "right",
      "lines": [
        "Kael! Can you really hear the souls of monsters?",
        "I saw a shadow with glowing eyes near the old trees!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "guard_doran",
      "name": "Doran",
      "look": "guard",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 26,
      "facing": "right",
      "lines": [
        "Halt— oh, it is you, Kael.",
        "The south road is quiet. Too quiet, since the Shattering storms began."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "edrick",
      "name": "Edrick",
      "look": "guard",
      "x": 23,
      "y": 19,
      "facing": "left",
      "lines": [
        "The forest has grown quiet. Too quiet.",
        "I used to hear Eidolons calling from the treeline at dusk. Now even the birds fall silent.",
        "The old road is cracked, but it still leads east. Keep your guard up, Kael.",
        "If you find anything strange out there, come back and tell me. Don't face it alone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "seren",
      "name": "Seren",
      "look": "villager",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 19,
      "facing": "right",
      "lines": [
        "I need fresh herbs from the forest.",
        "The roots have begun to twist around the old stones. It is as if the earth is holding its breath.",
        "People say Aether once made these fields bloom. I only wish I knew how to ask it for help.",
        "Please be careful among the roots, Kael."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "darian",
      "name": "Darian",
      "look": "farmer",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 18,
      "facing": "down",
      "lines": [
        "The merchant road is gone. We make do with what remains.",
        "Travelers used to bring stories from all seven kingdoms. These days, most stories end at the edge of the ash.",
        "Still, I keep a few old trinkets. Sometimes the past is worth more than coin."
      ]
    }
  ],
